{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test your skills and become the champion of the Universal Games!</strong> <br>The galaxy is watching you in this <strong>once-in-a-millennium competition</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <strong>OMEXYAN</strong>, where movement, rhythm, and skill rule the arena! Feel the adrenaline in this dynamic VR game that challenges your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Dive into the world of OMEXYAN, where reflexes, precision, and skill dominate in an exciting VR adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the color-catching devices in your hands to collect incoming red and green orbs. Then, control two colorful remote devices to aim at and hit the matching-colored cubes accurately. In the third challenge, wield a sporty laser weapon to shoot the correct-colored targets with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points, unlock new levels and arenas, and face increasingly challenging and diverse tasks. With a fast-paced soundtrack accompanying your gameplay, OMEXYAN ensures you\u2019re fully immersed in a dynamic and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game focuses on skill-based challenges and dynamic VR gameplay, offering exciting and captivating entertainment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3413260?t=1745249790","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745249790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/b66bfd985427d7293939729ac52d79f8b69016e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745249790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/b66bfd985427d7293939729ac52d79f8b69016e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745249790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-handed mode? Yes, it\u2019s here \u2013 because everyone is a player. In OMEXYAN, this feature was primarily designed for those living with physical challenges, but it\u2019s open to anyone who prefers a more comfortable or simply different way to play. Our goal was to make sure that everyone, under any circumstances, can fully enjoy the championship of the universe.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/extras/K\u00e9perny\u0151k\u00e9p_2025-04-06_124355.png?t=1745249790\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Test your skills and become the champion of the Universal Games!</strong> <br>The galaxy is watching you in this <strong>once-in-a-millennium competition</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of <strong>OMEXYAN</strong>, where movement, rhythm, and skill rule the arena! Feel the adrenaline in this dynamic VR game that challenges your reflexes and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Dive into the world of OMEXYAN, where reflexes, precision, and skill dominate in an exciting VR adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the color-catching devices in your hands to collect incoming red and green orbs. Then, control two colorful remote devices to aim at and hit the matching-colored cubes accurately. In the third challenge, wield a sporty laser weapon to shoot the correct-colored targets with precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points, unlock new levels and arenas, and face increasingly challenging and diverse tasks. With a fast-paced soundtrack accompanying your gameplay, OMEXYAN ensures you\u2019re fully immersed in a dynamic and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game focuses on skill-based challenges and dynamic VR gameplay, offering exciting and captivating entertainment.</p>","developers":["2 Crying Attic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413260/c7d9840d696054c3c22fd10d693ad14f133d079c/header.jpg?t=1745249790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121534,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121534/movie480.mp4?t=1743633954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121534/movie_max.mp4?t=1743633954"},"name":"OMEXYAN Alpha Centauri Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121534/3811cd8a73d6c4203c707ce983e143a4d61bd50d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743633954","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121534/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743633954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121534/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743633954"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257128807,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128807/movie480.mp4?t=1745249760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128807/movie_max.mp4?t=1745249760"},"name":"TRIALS OF THE PILLARS-Pillar Paths \u2013 Trials of Czoloum  ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128807/19c548a80d08dd995f214e33cb4e799218a2eb45/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745249760","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128807/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745249760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128807/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745249760"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257122711